former":"🔥Toronto Businesses & Startups"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"GIRLS & GAYS BRUNCH! 🌈 (AT MIA BRUNCH BAR )","url":"https://www.meetup.com/vibe-in-the-six/events/316514485/","description":"HI lovely people,\n\nI will still be hosting this brunch , but instead it will be October 17th .\n\nThe location is still the same !\n📍 21 Grenville Street - MIA Brunch Bar\n( make sure you DONT go to the Yonge location)\n\nWE WILL MEET OUT FRONT AT 9:45 SHARP. Brunch will be at 10.\n(I will update everyone on how to find me. Just haven't picked my outfit yet !)\n\n💲BRING CASH JUST IN CASE !\n\n🍽 Menu :MIA Brunch Bar - Toronto [https://share.google/X9vbZkKJZbnBEIPe](https://share.google/X9vbZkKJZbnBEIPe)\n\nOnly 5 spots - Please don't bring extras\n\nThis is a Brunch for girls ( gay, Bisexual or Straight) , Gay & Bisexual men\n\n🌈FOR THOSE OF YOU WHO DON'T WANT CERTAIN THINGS OUT THERE , THE RESERVATION WILL BE UNDER MY LAST NAME, NOT THE EVENT NAME.\n\n🎉 Let's make the first event super fun & chill! ! & I'll see u there !\n\nfeel free to message me with any questions\nxox","startDate":"2026-10-17T13:45:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-2-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"","addressRegion":"","addressCountry":""}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"VIBE IN THE SIX🌇( TORONTO GROUP)","url":"https://www.meetup.com/vibe-in-the-six/"},"performer":"VIBE IN THE SIX🌇( TORONTO GROUP)"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"Wizards & Workouts - FREE","url":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-science-fiction-and-fantasy-writers-meetup/events/316670376/","description":"Do you consider rolling dice strength training?\nCan you run a D&D campaign, but not a city block?\nIf so, **WIZARDS & WORKOUTS** is for you.\n\nMy name is Peter Reynolds. I'm a writer and lover of role playing games. I'm also out of shape. I've been looking for ways to motivate myself to start working out with the same enthusiasm I bring to my Dungeons & Dragons campaign.\n\nThe plan is simple: host a fun, live role playing game where players take on the role of their favourite fantasy characters. The catch? You need to exercise if you want to succeed. Fighting a dragon? A fireball might cost you 5 pushups. Crossing a rooftop? Can you balance on one foot for a minute?\n\nBy combining simple, low impact exercises, including walking & stretching, with an interactive adventure, we'll all get healthier, have fun and maybe meet some new friends along the way. All fitness levels are welcome (as are dogs), and no previous knowledge of Dungeons & Dragons is necessary.\n\nWe meet in front of Broadview subway station at 10:00 am sharp and then walk to the Outdoor Fitness Station in Riverdale Park East (there are washrooms). At noon we start walking west, through the park, ending at the Blake House Restaurant \\* (Wellesley & Jarvis) by 12:30.\n\nAll sessions are free and I’ll be running them till it gets too cold. Hope to see you there!\n\n* The Blake House is where our Sci-Fi and Fantasy Writers' Group meets every Saturday from 1pm - 4pm to critique each other’s work. For more information on this event. Check out our Meetup events page.","startDate":"2026-10-17T14:00:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-1-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"Broadview Subway Station","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Ontario","addressRegion":"on","addressCountry":"ca","streetAddress":"769 Broadview Avenue, Ontario, on"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Toronto Science Fiction and Fantasy Writers","url":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-science-fiction-and-fantasy-writers-meetup/"},"performer":"Toronto Science Fiction and Fantasy Writers"}]</script><link rel="preload" href="https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/b/1/2/highres_536199698.jpeg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><link rel="preload" href="https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/c/9/e/5/highres_536151685.jpeg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><link rel="preload" href="https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/4/3/6/4/highres_533117252.jpeg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><link rel="preload" href="https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/7/0/2/3/highres_535348707.jpeg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><link rel="preload" href="https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/a/c/4/b/highres_529064107.jpeg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><link rel="preload" href="https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/c/5/5/6/highres_535430518.jpeg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><link rel="preload" href="https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/3/9/9/7/highres_507254743.jpeg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><link rel="preload" href="https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/8/2/5/1/highres_520173361.jpeg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><meta name="next_csrf" content="8d15db5d-048c-42c1-bfa3-371ee29f3c1e"/><script>(function(){try{if(typeof performance==="undefined"||!performance.getEntriesByType)return;var n=performance.getEntriesByType("navigation");if(!n||!n[0]||!n[0].name)return;var u=new URL(n[0].name);var h=u.hash||"";var m=h.match(/:~:text=([^&]+)/);if(m){window.__meetup_text_fragment__={hasTextFragment:true,textFragment:decodeURIComponent(m[1]).trim().slice(0,100),capturedAt:Date.now()}}else{window.__meetup_text_fragment__={hasTextFragment:false,capturedAt:Date.now()}}}catch(e){}})()</script><script>(function(){try{var hasCookie=document.cookie.split(';').some(function(c){return c.trim()==='isNativeApp=true'});var hasParam=window.location.search.indexOf('isNativeApp=true')!==-1;if(!hasCookie&&!hasParam)return;var s=document.createElement('style');s.te