ghres_324016184.jpeg","baseUrl":"https://secure-content.meetupstatic.com/images/classic-member/"},"Member:183471017":{"__typename":"Member","id":"183471017","name":"Lily ","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:324016184"}},"Event:313710666":{"__typename":"Event","id":"313710666","title":"🚐 Doors Open Niagara-on-the-Lake Road Trip!  Saturday, October 17","dateTime":"2026-10-17T08:00:00-04:00","description":"**🚐 Doors Open Niagara-on-the-Lake Road Trip!**\n**Saturday, October 17**\n\nLet’s hit the road for another Doors Open adventure! We’ll be heading to beautiful **Doors Open Niagara-on-the-Lake** to explore historic buildings, cultural sites, and hidden spaces that are rarely open to the public.\nNick has been a **Doors Open Toronto volunteer for over two decades**, and he always enjoys checking out Doors Open events in other cities. Niagara-on-the-Lake is known for its incredible heritage architecture, charming streets, and fascinating history—making it a perfect destination for a Doors Open day trip.\n\n***\n\n### 🏛️ What is Doors Open?\n\nIf you’ve never attended before, **Doors Open** is a free architectural and cultural event held in communities across Ontario. For one special weekend, cities open the doors to historic buildings, cultural institutions, churches, theatres, and other interesting spaces—many of which are normally closed to the public.\nVisitors can explore at their own pace, learn about local history, and sometimes go behind the scenes with guided tours or special access.\n\nLearn more about the event here:\n👉 [https://www.doorsopenontario.on.ca/pages/events/niagara-on-the-lake](https://www.doorsopenontario.on.ca/pages/events/niagara-on-the-lake)\n\n***\n\n### 🗓️ The Plan\n\n* **Departure:** 8:00 AM from just outside **Christie Station**\n* **Transportation:** Rental minivan or SUV\n* **Destination:** **Niagara-on-the-Lake**\n* Spend the day exploring **Doors Open sites around town**\n* Time permitting we may be able to visit Niagara Falls after for a few photos/sightseeing\n* **Return to Toronto:** Around **6:00 PM**, depending on traffic\n\nYou’re welcome to explore with the group or wander off to check out sites that interest you most. The day will be relaxed and flexible.\n\n***\n\n### 🍽️ Food \u0026 Drink\n\nYou are responsible for **your own food and drink purchases** throughout the day.\n\n***\n\n### 💰 Cost\n\n**$60 round-trip**\nThis covers:\n\n* Car rental\n* Insurance\n* Fuel\n\nTo secure your spot, **all participants must e-transfer $60 to:**\n📧 **[nicolasbello@yahoo.com](mailto:nicolasbello@yahoo.com)**\nSpots are limited based on vehicle capacity, so please RSVP only if you’re able to commit.\n\n***\n\n### 🌦️ Weather Note\n\nThis event **runs rain or shine**, so please **dress appropriately for the weather**. The good news is that we’ll be **inside most of the time**, but there will still be some walking between locations.\n\n***\n\n### 🎒 What to Bring\n\n* Comfortable walking shoes\n* Curiosity \u0026 good vibes\n* A little patience for traffic (it’s part of the road-trip charm!)\n\nJoin us for a fun architectural adventure and a chance to explore one of Ontario’s most historic towns. 🚐🏛️","eventType":"PHYSICAL","eventUrl":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-movies-and-social-group/events/313710666/","isAttending":false,"isSaved":false,"maxTickets":6,"rsvpState":"JOIN_OPEN","featuredEventPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:533117252"},"displayPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:533117252"},"feeSettings":null,"group":{"__ref":"Group:5774262"},"socialProofInsights":null,"rsvps":{"__typename":"RsvpConnection","totalCount":6,"edges":[{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":true,"member":{"__ref":"Member:1936372"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:174762562"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":{"__ref":"Member:8092816"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":false,"member":