baseUrl":"https://secure-content.meetupstatic.com/images/classic-member/"},"Member:222715908":{"__typename":"Member","id":"222715908","name":"Steve Beattie","memberPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:307696925"}},"Event:316539050":{"__typename":"Event","id":"316539050","dateTime":"2026-10-03T09:00:00-04:00","isAttending":false,"group":{"__typename":"Group","urlname":"toronto-wim-hof-method-meetup-group"}},"Event:316635624":{"__typename":"Event","id":"316635624","dateTime":"2026-10-10T09:00:00-04:00","isAttending":false,"group":{"__typename":"Group","urlname":"toronto-wim-hof-method-meetup-group"}},"Event:316734709":{"__typename":"Event","id":"316734709","dateTime":"2026-10-17T09:00:00-04:00","isAttending":false,"group":{"__typename":"Group","urlname":"toronto-wim-hof-method-meetup-group","__ref":"Group:35945877"},"title":"Community Wim Hof practice","description":"It's better when we're together. Come and experience the power of the WHM with a wonderful group of people. We breathe, we go into the cold and we teach our bodies to heat up properly. We develop resilience and the mindset to use these powerful healing tools over and over again, all year round. This gathering is fully guided by Wim Hof instructor Steve Beattie.\n\nIf you are new to this, come on down, enjoy the support and practice in a safe way with us. If you already have a WHM practice this meetup is a great way to take it to the next level, and make lots of new friends.\n\nThere will be a fire, snacks and drinks shared by other attendees. We have been doing this 6 for years!\n\n**What to bring?**\n\n* Yoga mat\n* Weather-appropriate clothing (better to dress too warm!)\n* Bathing suite, towel\n* Water shoes (optional)\n\nIn extreme weather being prepared is very important. Especially if it's your first time, please read up on how to come prepared [here.](https://www.breathinginnature.com/wim-hof-method-meetup/)\n\nLearn more about our Wim Hof meetups, workshops, breath classes, wilderness trips, medicine work a